==================================================
ROLE-BASED USER FLOW
==================================================

The application should conceptually follow this structure:

USER AUTHENTICATION
        ↓
ROLE IDENTIFICATION
        ↓
        ├── BUYER → BUYER APPLICATION
        │
        ├── AGENT → AGENT PORTAL
        │
        └── BUILDER → BUILDER PORTAL

A Buyer must not be redirected to the Agent Portal.

A Buyer must not be redirected to the Builder Portal.

An Agent must not be redirected to the Builder Portal.

A Builder must not be redirected to the Agent Portal.

Keep the three role experiences visually consistent with the SAI brand but functionally separate.

The final result should clearly distinguish:

1. Buyer / Property Seeker
2. Agent / Broker
3. Builder who constructs apartment projects and sells individual apartments or units

The main objective is to remove role contamination from the existing SAI application without unnecessarily redesigning the entire visual interface.